e": "shot_cartas.png", "id": "2091830111763521", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310734_2091830115096854_1901302211623386848_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mtJ0OAQsWA4Q7kNvwEDIdbk&_nc_oc=AdoVF3kZViDb0HX4x-jQ3PUPIRdjqpv3DXwdBoS33nosSKwthlitegiMmBKpBbmKYRU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNkBCPX_7SX2xnvR3i3Ggal41zWe7Y1-2VoLal2N4Lb7A&oe=6AC51388"}, {"file_name": "menu_principal_2560x1440.png", "id": "1391604622857290", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296123_1391604626190623_9221660103299425430_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jUAY9wWzXK0Q7kNvwF9RqV-&_nc_oc=AdplpINeQNn8YjSKgu9DpvgBLNWjJrjYbsnJRIwvEp68eFWPWVWgQjnA_2gFgF8bleM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNsE0gbauCHRI00-UU969TOWOBek5Mwf55WKOYEsSEsgA&oe=6AC4F21D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1055405800356137", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293803_1055405803689470_2789295859101409422_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oeASwQedIaAQ7kNvwEK2s5o&_nc_oc=AdoEuc2eO7yr0nS4LYVU87DotQWH7JfvRgct-74xpjUWd9D81iyWzQrRrARZsf1dC4w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOGJ_Zqlb1UfBUUgsYX472uitl-8XywOvzmccSYncMupg&oe=6AC50754"}, "display_name": "First Date Simulator", "keywords": ["date", "match"], "long_description": "On a first date, everyone performs a little. First Date Simulator takes the stage away. No photo. No swipe. No profile to polish. Just someone across from you, asking.\n\nCarly walks in, sits down, turns toward you and holds your gaze. She talks out loud. And she asks the things that would normally take three dates to ask. You don't type and you don't talk: a deck of five cards is strapped to your left hand, and you answer by throwing one. Yes!, Yes, Neutral, No, No way! The card you let fly says more about you than any bio ever could.\n\n\u2022 Seated date: a table, two chairs, her across from you.\n\u2022 Walking date: out in the city, with her beside you, half a step ahead, the way you walk when you don't want the conversation to end.\n\u2022 Twelve questions a round, out of 144. Every card you throw adjusts an 8-trait read of you, and the next question comes from whatever she is least sure about.\n\u2022 When the date ends, your affinity with Carly lands on screen.\n\u2022 Press B to walk out of a question or a date whenever you want.\n\nSingle-player experience with an in-game character. For adults,.\n\nTwelve questions. No profile to hide behind. Sit down.", "short_description": "Nobody here is grading you.\nCarly sits across the table, holds your gaze, and asks. You don't type and you don't talk: you answer by throwing a card. Yes!, Yes, Neutral, No, No way! Twelve questions a round, out of 144 \u2014 she asks about what she still doesn't know about you.\nSingle-player experience with an in-game character. "}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1551089623222468", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "First Date Simulator", "keywords": ["cita", "date", "match"], "long_description": "En una primera cita todo el mundo act\u00faa un poco. First Date Simulator te quita el escenario. No hay foto. No hay swipe. No hay perfil que maquillar. Solo alguien enfrente, preguntando.\n\nCarly entra caminando, se sienta, gira hacia ti y te sostiene la mirada. Te habla en voz alta. Y te pregunta cosas que normalmente tardar\u00edas tres citas en preguntar. T\u00fa no escribes ni hablas: llevas un mazo de cinco cartas anclado a la mano izquierda y respondes lanzando una. \u00a1S\u00ed!, S\u00ed, Neutral, No, \u00a1Para nada! La carta que sale volando dice m\u00e1s de ti que cualquier biograf\u00eda.\n\n\u2022 Cita sentados: una mesa, dos sillas y ella enfrente.\n\u2022 Cita caminando: la ciudad, y ella a tu lado, ligeramente por delante, como cuando no quieres que la conversaci\u00f3n termine.\n\u2022 Doce preguntas por ronda, de 144 posibles. Cada carta que lanzas ajusta un perfil interno de 8 rasgos, y la siguiente pregunta sale de aquello sobre lo que a\u00fan le queda m\u00e1s duda.\n\u2022 Al terminar la cita, tu afinidad con Carly aparece en pantalla.\n\u2022 Con el bot\u00f3n B te sales de la pregunta o de la cita cuando quieras.\n\nExperiencia individual con un personaje del juego. Para adultos, 18+.\n\nDoce preguntas. Ning\u00fan perfil detr\u00e1s del que esconderte. Si\u00e9ntate.", "short_description": "Aqu\u00ed nadie te est\u00e1 puntuando.\nCarly se sienta enfrente, te mira a los ojos y pregunta. T\u00fa no escribes ni hablas: respondes lanzando una carta. \u00a1S\u00ed!, S\u00ed, Neutral, No, \u00a1Para nada! Doce preguntas por ronda, de 144 posibles, elegidas por lo que todav\u00eda no sabe de ti.\nExperiencia individual con un personaje del juego. Para adultos, 18+."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/d55d2399-e2d8-4859-9004-0bbee6f01242", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Francisco Manuel Mier y Teran Almazan", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/d55d2399-e2d8-4859-9004-0bbee6f01242", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es_MX"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER